非常重要的一集。

1984
01:20:26.050 --> 01:20:33.950
I mean, listen, the rest of this season two is just going to be one momentous episode after the other.
我是说，听着，第二季剩下的部分将会是一集比一集更重大的剧集。

1985
01:20:34.170 --> 01:20:41.470
